@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber


actor Client as "gRPC Client"
participant Server as "gRPC Server" #APPLICATION
participant Router #APPLICATION
participant Connector as "LLM Connector" #APPLICATION
participant PS as "Prompt Source" #APPLICATION
participant PP as "External\nPrompt Provider"
participant LLM as "External\nLLM"

Client-> Server: "Open bidirectional stream"

activate Client
Client->>Server: Send prompt name & data
activate Server

Server-> Router: Route request
Router-> Connector: Forward to appropriate connector

Connector-> PS: Get prompt templates
PS-> PP: Retrieve templates
PP--> PS: Return templates
PS--> Connector: Return user & system templates

Connector->>Connector: Interpolate data with templates

Connector-> LLM: Send processed request

loop Response streaming
    LLM-->>Connector: Stream response chunks
    Connector-->>Router: Forward chunks
    Router-->>Server: Forward chunks
    Server-->>Client: Stream response chunks
end

LLM-->>Connector: Complete response
Connector-->>Router: Signal completion
Router-->>Server: Signal completion
Server-->> Client: Close stream
deactivate Client

@enduml


